"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"NOT\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Patient is stable\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"and has no significant medical conditions that would interfere with the study.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Has joint contracture\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or spasticity.\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Loss of function is expected to be improved by reliable tendon transfer, tenodesis or arthrodesis that is available.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Evidence of recovering finger/thumb extension at 4-6 months.\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Greater than 12 months from spinal cord injury.\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Subject not fluent in English or an appropriate translator not available.\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"